blurb = "Depicts a small figure carrying bundles of firewood crossing a bridge formed by a tree growing over a gorge. In the background is a mountain peak shrouded in clouds.

The village of Goka no Shō is in present-day Kumamoto prefecture. According to legend, the area provided safe haven to surviving members of the Taira clan following their defeat by the Minamoto clan in the 12th century."
